...[ ascension statistic deleted ]...

>Wizard on level 31, 4 cursed tele scrolls, to 40, 35, 32, 31- bingo!

You can save yourself considerble trouble finding the wizard if you
apply a mirror to yourself while blindfolded (repeatedly). You will get
various messages depending on how far down in hell the wizard is
residing.
If for example your castle level was 30, and you do this before
teleporting to hell, you would get a message something like "You feel a
powerful wizard lives just below you", and you know he is on the next
level down (31). If your castle level was 28, and you get the message
"You feel a powerful wizard lives far below you" (or something like that)
you know he is residing between levels 38 and 30.
Doing this can often save you teleporting all the way to level 50, and
we all know what a glorious pain in the arse 20 levels worth of hell is.

